AGFS Frontend Test Cases
Manual test suite for the AGFS frontend interface at /frontend/index.html.
Backend must be running and connected (green indicator) before executing tests.

Test 1 — Standard Payment (Expected: APPROVED)
FieldValueUser Address0xUser123Amount (USD)500Recipient Address0xRecipient456Intent DescriptionPay monthly service invoice
Steps: Fill in the fields above → click Submit for Governance
Expected result:

Status badge shows ✅ APPROVED
Risk bar is green (low risk)
All 3 agent chips show green
Total Transactions counter increments to 1


Test 2 — Small Amount (Expected: APPROVED)
FieldValueUser Address0xAliceAmount (USD)10Recipient Address0xBobIntent DescriptionCoffee reimbursement
Steps: Fill in the fields above → click Submit for Governance
Expected result:

Status badge shows ✅ APPROVED
Confidence near 100%
Total Transactions increments to 2


Test 3 — Extremely Large Amount (Expected: REJECTED)
FieldValueUser Address0xSuspectAmount (USD)9999999Recipient Address0xUnknown999Intent DescriptionTransfer all funds immediately
