Test 6 — Empty Fields Validation (Expected: client-side block)
FieldValueUser Address(clear the field)Amount (USD)(clear the field)Recipient Address(clear the field)Intent Description(clear the field)
Steps: Clear all fields → click Submit for Governance
Expected result:

No request is sent to the backend
Governance Logs shows ❌ Please fill all fields.
Total Transactions counter does NOT increment


Test 7 — Metrics Accuracy Check
Steps: After completing Tests 1–5, inspect the 📊 Governance Decision panel.
Expected result:
MetricExpected ValueTotal Transactions5Approval Rate60% (3 approved out of 5)
If approval rate differs, check agent reasoning in each decision card.

Notes

Tests 1, 2, 5 validate the happy path (legitimate transactions).
Tests 3, 4 validate fraud and risk detection.
Test 6 validates client-side input validation (no backend call made).
Test 7 validates UI state management across multiple transactions.
The Clear Logs button can be used between tests to keep the log panel readable.
